  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "想象一次商品信息读取。",
      "startMs": 871.7391304347826,
      "endMs": 2926.086956521739,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "编号零一的请求来到应用，想拿到商品价格。",
      "startMs": 3415.2173913043475,
      "endMs": 7073.913043478261,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "应用没有立刻去数据库，而是先问旁边的缓存：这里有结果吗？",
      "startMs": 7610.869565217391,
      "endMs": 12263.04347826087,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "第一次，缓存是空的。",
      "startMs": 12795.652173913042,
      "endMs": 14559.782608695652,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "这叫缓存未命中，请求继续走到数据库。",
      "startMs": 15089.130434782608,
      "endMs": 18361.95652173913,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "数据库找到价格后，结果沿原路返回。",
      "startMs": 18850.0,
      "endMs": 21821.73913043478,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "在经过缓存时，它也留一份在缓存里。",
      "startMs": 22339.130434782608,
      "endMs": 25407.608695652172,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "现在，相同请求再次到来。",
      "startMs": 25915.217391304348,
      "endMs": 28065.217391304348,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "缓存已经有结果，这叫缓存命中。",
      "startMs": 28380.434782608696,
      "endMs": 31293.478260869564,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "结果直接从缓存返回，请求不用再走到数据库。",
      "startMs": 31793.478260869564,
      "endMs": 35479.34782608695,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "所以缓存加速的关键，不是让数据库变快，而是让重复读取少走了数据库这一段。",
      "startMs": 36000.0,
      "endMs": 42602.17391304348,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ]
